{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，大埔警區特別職務隊聯同相關部門，今日（15日）下午約4時在大埔大埔墟及上水石湖墟一帶街道及多個單位展開代號「火石」的掃黃行動。執法人員在大埔廣福道、上水巡撫街的單位內拘捕共9名年齡介乎24歲至50歲的內地女子，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由相關部門跟進。</p><p>據了解，所有被捕女子持雙程證到港。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187543229751365632013284.jpeg/U9FUNSllSt4k142FvWIBhoCHJy88Uplo8RUFmfEVBZk\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187543232372936704068143.jpeg/yE8hEfm-PKh_P3sPGxMlRIPO3F1wURtNx_0eHMf9Hhw\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:49.552334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:55.392644+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:13.172636+00:00","content_hash":"ae5f93bb15c0141bb336033ab8cfaa22f7f798431c24ef3f073b3ef2362baa8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}